<doc src="builtin:lifecycle"/>
<doc src="builtin:skills"/>
<doc src="builtin:project-instructions"/>
Coordinate two recurring release-note reviews. The controller's initial turn
prepares the reviews. The lifecycle script checks the two captured workers'
actual retained outcomes before asking the host to complete the Goal.
</developer>
